        "original_id": "c2e9861c-dd07-5acf-9353-16d47bea7227",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vladimir Kozlov, Santino Marella, Anthony Carelli, Kyriakos Georgiou, Jaimal Patel\n- Organizations: WWE, Sportsnet\n- Events: Vengeance (2006)\n- Places: Charlotte Bobcats Arena, Charlotte, North Carolina\n- Roles: sports analyst, trainer, entrepreneur, actor, retired professional wrestler, mixed martial artist\n- Films: Criminals Game, Criminals Game II, Duality\n- Championships: WWE Tag Team Championship\n\nFacts:\n- Vengeance (2006) was a WWE professional wrestling pay-per-view event that took place on June 25, 2006, at the Charlotte Bobcats Arena in Charlotte, North Carolina.\n- Anthony Carelli was born on March 14, 1974.\n- Anthony Carelli is a Canadian sports analyst, trainer, entrepreneur, actor, and retired professional wrestler and mixed martial artist.\n- Anthony Carelli currently works for the Canadian sports TV network Sportsnet.\n- Vladimir Kozlov is best known for his time in WWE, where he won the WWE Tag Team Championship once with Santino Marella.\n- Kyriakos Georgiou is best known for playing Vladimir Kozlov in the films Criminals Game and Criminals Game II.\n- Kyriakos Georgiou also played James Baker in the film Duality, which was written and directed by Jaimal Patel.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
